    "name": "BasilCare API",
    "description": "BasilCare REST API (Jakarta EE 11 on WildFly).\n\n1. Import this collection and BasilCare-local.postman_environment.json, select the environment.\n2. Collection > Authorization > Get New Access Token: signs in through the IAM with OAuth 2.0 authorization code + PKCE (user admin, password = ADMIN_PASSWORD, change-me-now in development).\n3. Run the folders in order (Collection Runner works). The ingest folder uses the X-Ingest-Key service key instead of a user token.\n\nEndpoint reference: api/README.md.",
